'''Roosey''' is a [[Pixies|pixie]] [[Non-Playable-Character|NPC]] [[Merchants|merchant]] that can be found near the [[Cobblestone Village]] Cooking Table. She sells exclusively [[Brawler]] [[Jobs|Job]] [[Items|items]].

==Sells==
*Bell Brawler Shoulderpads
*Bell Brawler Pants
*Bell Brawler Bandana
*Bell Brawler Gloves
*Bell Brawler Boots
*Bell Brawler Shirt
*[[Brawler's Flair Shard of Valentines]]
*[[Brawler's Flair Shard of Smoldering]]
*Brawler's Power Shard of Regeneration I
*Brawler's Ring of Energy I
*Brawler's Necklace of Bark Skin I
*[[Brawler's Mallet of Sweeps]]

==Trivia==
*Roosey was introduced to in-game on August 6, 2013.
